guide forever/class/hunter/taming-the-beast-horde
title Taming the Beast (Horde)
category Class
class Hunter
folder Hunter
faction Horde
race Orc, Troll, Tauren, Skyborne
levels 10-10
zone Durotar
keywords Taming the Beast, Training the Beast, The Hunter's Path, Taming Rod, Tame Beast, Beast Training, pet, Thotar, Yaw Sharpmane, Quel'ana Quickgale, Ormak Grimshot, Holt Thunderhorn, Quel'dora Quickgale, Razor Hill, Bloodhoof Village, Valanaar, pet trainer, Hunter
